01:21:57.519 --> 01:21:58.178
Babe...


01:22:00.022 --> 01:22:01.717
youre welcome to stay
if you want to.


01:22:01.790 --> 01:22:04.520
But if you don't,
III drive you to the airport tomorrow.


01:22:07.696 --> 01:22:08.594
Good night.


01:22:20.676 --> 01:22:22.837
- III miss you.
- Take care.


01:22:23.879 --> 01:22:25.779
Stay in touch. See at the wedding.


01:22:25.847 --> 01:22:27.405
- Imran, can you help me?
- Of course.


01:22:27.482 --> 01:22:28.684
For sure. Okay?


01:22:28.685 --> 01:22:30.385
- Email me.
- I will.


01:22:30.385 --> 01:22:31.215
Good luck.


01:22:34.356 --> 01:22:35.414
Hey...


01:22:40.562 --> 01:22:42.257
Yesterday was...


01:22:46.335 --> 01:22:47.825
I had the best time yesterday.


01:22:49.404 --> 01:22:50.530
Me too.


01:22:52.407 --> 01:22:54.242
And good luck...


01:22:54.242 --> 01:22:56.540
for your upcoming adventures.


01:22:58.647 --> 01:22:59.875
