01:33:25.540 --> 01:33:26.700
I love this song.


01:33:30.345 --> 01:33:33.872
Rock chick in a hard rock world...


01:33:36.951 --> 01:33:40.944
Im a rock chick in a hard rock world...


01:33:44.125 --> 01:33:48.152
