01:36:18.112 --> 01:36:19.079
Car.


01:36:19.313 --> 01:36:20.214
Road.


01:36:20.214 --> 01:36:21.181
Arjun.


01:36:21.482 --> 01:36:22.346
Brother.


01:36:22.517 --> 01:36:23.381
Diary.


01:36:23.451 --> 01:36:24.284
Poetry.


01:36:24.285 --> 01:36:25.153
Heart.


01:36:25.153 --> 01:36:25.710
Love.


01:36:25.787 --> 01:36:26.654
Mumbai.


01:36:26.654 --> 01:36:27.522
