01:48:46.126 --> 01:48:47.787
<i>I don't know.</i>


01:48:48.161 --> 01:48:51.028
<i>What you've said to me, SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:48:51.732 --> 01:48:55.190
<i>Even then, I have no idea why.</i>


