<i>I like what I heard, SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:49:09.683 --> 01:49:12.015
<i>Don't look away.</i>


01:49:13.720 --> 01:49:15.881
<i>Stay close to me.</i>


01:49:17.558 --> 01:49:20.118
<i>Take me in your arms.</i>


01:49:20.694 --> 01:49:23.390
