01:49:29.136 --> 01:49:32.039
<i>Are never too less.</i>


01:49:32.039 --> 01:49:35.167
<i>Come let's lose ourselves in them.</i>


01:49:36.877 --> 01:49:39.209
<i>And forget we ever knew sadness.</i>


01:49:39.279 --> 01:49:43.079
<i>SeÃ±orita, listen to us</i>
SeÃ±orita, d'you hear what we're saying.


01:49:43.850 --> 01:49:46.978
<i>I will never understand.</i>


01:49:48.021 --> 01:49:51.081
<i>The meaning of the words</i>
you dedicate to me.


01:49:51.625 --> 01:49:54.594
<i>But the warmth of your gaze.</i>


01:49:55.829 --> 01:49:59.060
<i>Makes me feel like</i>
the most beautiful SeÃ±orita.


01:49:59.466 --> 01:50:03.704
<i>Our eyes looked at each other.</i>


01:50:03.704 --> 01:50:06.605
<i>And recounted tales of desire SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:50:07.307 --> 01:50:11.107
<i>That for affection and for love.</i>


01:50:11.345 --> 01:50:15.645
<i>There is only one language</i>
in the world SeÃ±orita.


01:50:16.149 --> 01:50:18.549
<i>Don't look away from me now.</i>


01:50:20.020 --> 01:50:22.181
<i>Come closer to me.</i>


01:50:23.790 --> 01:50:26.623
<i>Take me in your arms.</i>


01:50:27.060 --> 01:50:30.393
<i>Hope you've understood SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:50:30.464 --> 01:50:33.922
<i>Even a few moments of love.</i>


01:50:35.469 --> 01:50:37.835
<i>Are never too less.</i>


01:50:38.405 --> 01:50:42.205
<i>Come let's lose ourselves in them.</i>


01:50:43.310 --> 01:50:45.679
<i>And forget we ever knew sadness.</i>


01:50:45.679 --> 01:50:50.048
<i>SeÃ±orita, listen to us</i>
SeÃ±orita, d'you hear what we're saying.


01:50:58.492 --> 01:51:00.983
<i>With every moment that has passed.</i>


01:51:02.996 --> 01:51:05.191
<i>Oh SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:51:06.900 --> 01:51:09.733
<i>You've managed to win my heart.</i>


01:51:10.137 --> 01:51:12.002
<i>And that's all there is to it.</i>


01:51:12.706 --> 01:51:14.731
<i>Don't look away.</i>


01:51:16.643 --> 01:51:18.804
<i>Stay close to me.</i>


01:51:20.347 --> 01:51:22.713
<i>Take me in your arms.</i>


01:51:23.684 --> 01:51:26.676
<i>Hope you've understood SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:51:27.154 --> 01:51:30.180
<i>Even a few moments of love.</i>


01:51:32.059 --> 01:51:34.084
<i>Are never too less.</i>


01:51:34.961 --> 01:51:38.488
<i>Come let's lose ourselves in them.</i>


01:51:39.866 --> 01:51:42.198
<i>And forget we ever knew sadness.</i>


01:52:21.675 --> 01:52:24.439
Remember before cable TV
we only had one national channel?


01:52:26.680 --> 01:52:29.205
And every Sunday
they showed a Hindi film.


01:52:30.617 --> 01:52:32.244
Get to the point.


01:52:33.720 --> 01:52:34.744
The point is...


01:52:35.622 --> 01:52:37.681
before the film there was this animation.


01:52:38.725 --> 01:52:41.216
A white circle went round and round
and formed the channel logo.


01:52:43.830 --> 01:52:45.024
Do you remember the tune?


01:53:05.218 --> 01:53:06.048
Brilliant!


01:53:17.798 --> 01:53:20.096
That tune never failed to depress me.


01:53:21.168 --> 01:53:22.157
Depressed.


01:53:23.904 --> 01:53:25.599
Im feeling the same right now.


01:53:28.742 --> 01:53:30.835
Weekends over and school begins.


01:53:31.278 --> 01:53:34.214
- And you wanted to cancel this trip!
- I know, man!


01:53:34.214 --> 01:53:35.442
Can you imagine?


01:53:39.452 --> 01:53:40.578
You know what that means?


01:53:42.055 --> 01:53:43.283
It means...


01:53:44.457 --> 01:53:46.618
that everything is predestined.


01:53:49.296 --> 01:53:50.354
Everything!


01:53:51.464 --> 01:53:54.922
This holiday was in our destiny.


01:53:56.136 --> 01:53:57.103
You know!


01:53:59.906 --> 01:54:01.703
You, me and asshole.


01:54:03.009 --> 01:54:04.670
- Cheers asshole.
- Wheres asshole?


01:54:06.813 --> 01:54:07.336
Cheers!


01:54:10.217 --> 01:54:11.707
Laila too.


01:54:15.789 --> 01:54:17.916
I was meant to meet her.


01:54:19.226 --> 01:54:20.591
You are in <i>louw</i>, my <i>bwoy</i>.


01:54:21.394 --> 01:54:22.520
No, man!


01:54:23.029 --> 01:54:24.394
You are in louw...


01:54:25.131 --> 01:54:26.399
You are in louw...


01:54:26.400 --> 01:54:29.266
- You are in <i>louw...</i>
- Kabir, man!


01:54:29.336 --> 01:54:31.702
Everything is written.
Listen to me.


01:54:31.905 --> 01:54:33.395
Its all predestined.


01:54:33.640 --> 01:54:34.474
You know what Im saying?


01:54:34.475 --> 01:54:36.642
This moment... us right now...


01:54:36.643 --> 01:54:38.111
its predestined.


01:54:38.111 --> 01:54:39.669
Predestined.


01:54:40.447 --> 01:54:42.472
Please stop saying, predestined...!


01:54:42.782 --> 01:54:44.306
I beg of you!


01:54:44.784 --> 01:54:47.319
This too is predestined.
Its all written.


01:54:47.320 --> 01:54:49.322
Alright, we get it.


01:54:49.322 --> 01:54:51.222
Listen, we get it, zip!


01:54:51.291 --> 01:54:52.451
Come on, man!


01:54:54.160 --> 01:54:55.127
Its true.


01:54:56.229 --> 01:54:57.397
Its predestined...


01:54:57.398 --> 01:54:58.295
Guys...


01:55:09.976 --> 01:55:10.840
Hola...


01:55:23.290 --> 01:55:24.780
Guys, watch out!


01:55:27.560 --> 01:55:28.618
What the hell, guys?


01:55:35.502 --> 01:55:36.298
Yes?


01:55:51.851 --> 01:55:54.721
- Our man is back.
- Their mobiles are switched off.


01:55:54.721 --> 01:55:55.710
- What?
- Yup.


01:55:55.789 --> 01:55:56.890
Even Nurias?


01:55:56.890 --> 01:55:58.448
Yes, Im shocked.


01:55:58.525 --> 01:56:01.585
When she knew wed land up in jail,
she shouldve kept the phone switched on.


01:56:02.963 --> 01:56:04.965
If our bail isnt posted...


01:56:04.965 --> 01:56:07.490
well be stuck here for days.


01:56:12.138 --> 01:56:13.002
Arjun...


01:56:14.674 --> 01:56:16.471
tell them I want to make a call.


01:56:17.510 --> 01:56:18.636
To whom?


01:56:19.713 --> 01:56:20.941
Salman Habib.


01:56:21.448 --> 01:56:22.472
The artist?


01:56:24.317 --> 01:56:25.011
Yeah.


01:56:26.386 --> 01:56:28.183
Why will he come to post our bail?


01:56:29.956 --> 01:56:31.116
Are you alright?


01:56:31.992 --> 01:56:34.394
Just because we cant reach anyone,
hes losing it.


01:56:34.395 --> 01:56:35.452
Hes my father.


01:56:36.329 --> 01:56:37.023
What?


01:56:39.499 --> 01:56:40.625
I am his son.


01:56:50.977 --> 01:56:52.171
Just let it go Imran.


01:56:54.848 --> 01:56:55.906
Just let it go.


01:56:56.483 --> 01:56:57.142
Hello...


01:56:58.518 --> 01:56:59.886
Hello, may I...


01:56:59.886 --> 01:57:02.047
speak with Mr. Salman Habib, please?


01:57:02.789 --> 01:57:03.517
Yes?


01:57:05.158 --> 01:57:06.887
Sir, I am Imran.


01:57:08.828 --> 01:57:11.319
I am Rahilas son.


01:57:15.635 --> 01:57:17.102
When did you find out?


01:57:20.407 --> 01:57:22.307
Afew days after Abu died.


01:57:25.111 --> 01:57:28.569
In his stuff, I found a letter
that Ammi had written to him.


01:57:30.016 --> 01:57:31.745
The letter stated that...


01:57:31.818 --> 01:57:37.518
Ammi was grateful that Abu had
accepted her and her unborn child.


01:57:40.860 --> 01:57:42.418
Why didn't you tell us?


01:57:45.465 --> 01:57:46.796
I was a bit shaken up.


01:57:48.535 --> 01:57:51.060
What would I tell you?
<i>Abu is not my father.</i>


01:57:53.706 --> 01:57:55.674
He loved you a lot.


01:57:57.210 --> 01:57:58.837
He really loved you.


01:58:00.780 --> 01:58:02.111
And us.


01:58:02.816 --> 01:58:04.817
I mean, think about it.


01:58:04.818 --> 01:58:07.353
Be it sports day or
parent-teacher meetings...


01:58:07.353 --> 01:58:10.686
our fathers seldom came,
but Abu was always there.


01:58:12.325 --> 01:58:14.520
Well, my father was dead.


01:58:15.028 --> 01:58:18.361
So, if he showed up for sports day
it wouldve been a bit strange.


01:58:25.305 --> 01:58:26.704
Youve got bail.


01:58:29.976 --> 01:58:31.273
Theyre here.


01:58:42.989 --> 01:58:43.853
Hi.


01:58:46.893 --> 01:58:47.689
Imran.


01:58:49.896 --> 01:58:50.863
Imran...


01:58:52.132 --> 01:58:52.996
Im Salman.


01:58:57.670 --> 01:58:59.739
My friends, Arjun and Kabir.


01:58:59.739 --> 01:59:00.933
- Hello.
- Thank you.


01:59:01.007 --> 01:59:02.304
Hi... thank you.


01:59:03.243 --> 01:59:05.234
You three look pretty hungover.


01:59:08.548 --> 01:59:11.346
Youre welcome to come over to
my place and freshen up.


01:59:12.018 --> 01:59:14.748
Our bags and car are at the hotel.


01:59:14.954 --> 01:59:16.353
III drive you there.


01:59:18.191 --> 01:59:18.885
Come.


01:59:33.873 --> 01:59:35.898
Wow, this is beautiful.


01:59:37.644 --> 01:59:38.668
Its really nice.


01:59:39.879 --> 01:59:42.074
Are you always so polite?


01:59:43.550 --> 01:59:46.849
Its absolute rubbish.
Anyone can do that.


01:59:47.654 --> 01:59:50.155
This gentleman, my neighbour...


01:59:50.156 --> 01:59:53.359
was obsessed with having his wife
immortalised in a potrait.


01:59:53.359 --> 01:59:56.886
So, I applied my brush
and fulfilled his desire.


01:59:56.963 --> 01:59:59.295
And with his money, paid my bills.


02:00:01.668 --> 02:00:04.000
So, what are you guys doing in Seville?


02:00:04.704 --> 02:00:06.072
Skydiving.


02:00:06.072 --> 02:00:07.232
- Really?
- Yeah.


02:00:07.307 --> 02:00:09.434
So, you jumped out of a plane
and landed in jail?


02:00:10.710 --> 02:00:12.075
You could say that.


02:00:12.545 --> 02:00:16.675
That apart, what do you do?


02:00:17.650 --> 02:00:19.277
Well, Im a financial broker.


02:00:19.652 --> 02:00:20.619
In London.


02:00:21.120 --> 02:00:22.178
Money man.


02:00:23.623 --> 02:00:24.351
And you?


02:00:24.991 --> 02:00:26.686
My family is in the construction business.


02:00:27.727 --> 02:00:30.093
Well, never mind.
Everyone makes mistakes.


02:00:31.064 --> 02:00:31.860
Thats funny.


02:00:32.498 --> 02:00:34.489
Youre a Xerox copy of him.


02:00:38.204 --> 02:00:39.899
And, what about you?


02:00:41.307 --> 02:00:42.205
I write.


02:00:43.876 --> 02:00:44.433
What?


02:00:45.311 --> 02:00:47.040
Im a copywriter in advertising.


02:00:48.114 --> 02:00:51.174
Writing copy for ads is like
a buffet for the masses.


02:00:51.551 --> 02:00:54.247
For instance, this painting is
for someone else.


02:00:55.688 --> 02:00:58.486
Do you write anything
to feed your own soul?


02:01:00.193 --> 02:01:01.524
I do.


02:01:06.332 --> 02:01:07.132
Sir?


02:01:07.200 --> 02:01:08.030
Salman.


02:01:08.735 --> 02:01:10.464
Right. Well be outside.


02:01:27.954 --> 02:01:31.117
Your hands are very similar to mine.


02:01:34.527 --> 02:01:35.494
Sit.


02:01:39.232 --> 02:01:40.130
Do you live alone?


02:01:40.633 --> 02:01:41.600
No.


02:01:42.302 --> 02:01:43.166
I have a wife.


02:01:43.536 --> 02:01:45.663
But she is away... in Paris.


02:01:46.172 --> 02:01:46.866
Sit.


02:01:49.976 --> 02:01:50.908
And any...


02:01:51.144 --> 02:01:52.304
children?


02:01:58.885 --> 02:02:00.113
Do you ever come to India?


02:02:01.154 --> 02:02:02.221
Yes.


02:02:02.221 --> 02:02:05.088
I was there four years ago
when my mother passed away.


02:02:06.459 --> 02:02:08.161
- Sorry.
- I have a brother there...


02:02:08.162 --> 02:02:09.128
but...


02:02:10.730 --> 02:02:12.027
we don't meet.


02:02:17.637 --> 02:02:20.003
Ive often thought about you.


02:02:21.974 --> 02:02:22.998
I mean...


02:02:24.477 --> 02:02:28.937
that someday, somewhere we might meet.


02:02:30.616 --> 02:02:33.052
But I never figured...


02:02:33.052 --> 02:02:35.612
what I would say to you.


02:02:37.290 --> 02:02:38.450
Just say the truth.


02:02:41.227 --> 02:02:43.422
The truth... what is the truth?


02:02:44.664 --> 02:02:47.224
Everyone has their own version.


02:02:52.572 --> 02:02:54.741
Look... I was...


02:02:54.741 --> 02:02:56.606
25 then.


02:02:57.777 --> 02:03:00.746
Rahila was a few years younger.


02:03:02.148 --> 02:03:04.884
When youre young
the future doesn't matter.


02:03:04.884 --> 02:03:06.511
We were just kids.


02:03:09.155 --> 02:03:11.214
One day...


02:03:11.290 --> 02:03:13.781
Rahila told me that shes...


02:03:14.394 --> 02:03:17.261
expecting a baby.


02:03:17.330 --> 02:03:20.231
I wasnt ready for
the responsibility then.


02:03:20.299 --> 02:03:22.199
And nor am I now.


02:03:28.708 --> 02:03:31.643
So... you just abandoned her?


02:03:35.515 --> 02:03:38.507
I guess, you could say that.


02:03:43.689 --> 02:03:48.217
Rahila wanted a family,
she wanted to be a mother.


02:03:49.529 --> 02:03:52.157
I had other dreams.
I wanted to be an artist.


02:03:53.166 --> 02:03:55.168
I wanted to paint...


02:03:55.168 --> 02:03:56.635
travel the world.


02:03:58.171 --> 02:04:00.573
I loved her but...


02:04:00.573 --> 02:04:03.599
she made her choice
and I made mine.


02:04:03.676 --> 02:04:05.473
Thats all.


02:04:09.382 --> 02:04:11.612
I found out about you
only last year.


02:04:15.555 --> 02:04:16.522
But...


02:04:18.224 --> 02:04:20.852
youve always known about me.


02:04:22.695 --> 02:04:25.357
Did you never want to see me?


02:04:27.500 --> 02:04:29.400
I thought it was better this way.


02:04:37.376 --> 02:04:39.867
You asked for the truth.


02:04:41.280 --> 02:04:42.406
Well, this is it.


02:04:45.151 --> 02:04:46.516
I... am sorry, Imran.


02:04:48.454 --> 02:04:49.478
No, youre not.


02:04:54.393 --> 02:04:56.793
Is there something
I can do for you?


02:04:58.364 --> 02:05:01.356
Apologise only when it comes from here.


02:05:24.624 --> 02:05:27.593
<i>When clouds of pain loom in the sky.</i>


02:05:28.294 --> 02:05:31.263
<i>When a shadow of sadness flickers by.</i>


02:05:32.064 --> 02:05:35.033
<i>When a tear flnds it's way to the eye.</i>


02:05:35.401 --> 02:05:38.370
<i>When fear keeps the loneliness alive.</i>


02:05:39.372 --> 02:05:44.010
<i>I try and console my heart</i>
Why is it that you cry? I ask.


02:05:44.010 --> 02:05:46.535
<i>This is only what life imparts.</i>


02:05:47.280 --> 02:05:49.680
<i>These deep silences within.</i>


02:05:50.182 --> 02:05:52.810
<i>Have been handed out to all by time.</i>


02:05:54.053 --> 02:05:56.544
<i>Everyone's story has a little sorrow.</i>


02:05:57.123 --> 02:05:59.785
<i>Everyone's share has a little Sunshine.</i>


02:06:01.160 --> 02:06:03.219
<i>No need for water in your eyes.</i>


02:06:04.630 --> 02:06:06.928
<i>Every moment can be a new life.</i>


02:06:08.334 --> 02:06:10.529
<i>Why do you let them pass you by.</i>


02:06:12.004 --> 02:06:13.972
<i>Oh heart, why is it that you cry?</i>


02:06:23.215 --> 02:06:24.375
Morning...


02:06:30.623 --> 02:06:31.647
Did you sleep or not?


02:06:33.292 --> 02:06:34.020
No.


02:06:43.202 --> 02:06:45.830
I think, we should get going.


02:06:47.540 --> 02:06:48.529
Lets go.


02:06:49.976 --> 02:06:50.601
Arjun...


02:06:54.780 --> 02:06:56.611
Im really sorry.


02:07:21.507 --> 02:07:22.565
III see you at the car.


02:07:22.808 --> 02:07:23.638
Yeah.


02:07:27.780 --> 02:07:29.680
What do you mean,
you slept in the car?


02:07:30.449 --> 02:07:31.746
Long story, babe.


02:07:32.818 --> 02:07:33.842
Tell me, what happened?


02:07:35.121 --> 02:07:37.089
Well, Imran just...


02:07:39.025 --> 02:07:40.185
III tell you later, okay.


02:07:41.060 --> 02:07:42.789
Why? Tell me now,
what happened?


02:07:43.129 --> 02:07:46.098
I cant tell you right now.
III tell you when Im back.


02:07:46.465 --> 02:07:47.932
Why are you getting irritated?


02:07:48.200 --> 02:07:50.065
Why are you going on about it?


02:07:50.302 --> 02:07:51.599
Okay, forget it.


02:07:56.042 --> 02:07:56.974
See.


02:07:57.343 --> 02:07:58.970
Its our wedding card.
Can you see it?


02:07:59.378 --> 02:08:00.777
Isnt it gorgeous?


02:08:01.313 --> 02:08:02.940
Im just so happy with it.


02:08:03.783 --> 02:08:06.385
Oh... Ive emailed a few options
for your suit.


02:08:06.385 --> 02:08:09.081
Please select one. Okay?
Dont forget.


02:08:09.555 --> 02:08:10.453
Okay.


02:08:12.692 --> 02:08:14.887
You are so far away.


02:08:16.195 --> 02:08:17.662
You love me, right?


02:08:19.031 --> 02:08:19.998
Yeah.


02:08:20.700 --> 02:08:22.565
Then stop fighting with me.


02:08:23.402 --> 02:08:26.530
Everything was fine before you
went on this holiday.


02:08:27.206 --> 02:08:29.003
Kabir, just come home.


02:08:29.508 --> 02:08:32.944
To me, your family, your friends.


02:08:33.345 --> 02:08:35.142
My friends are with me.


02:08:35.448 --> 02:08:37.416
Yeah, I know.
But you know what I mean.


02:08:48.994 --> 02:08:55.900
Happy birthday to you...


02:08:56.869 --> 02:09:00.498
Happy birthday dear Anjali...


02:09:01.173 --> 02:09:03.698
Happy birthday to you...


02:09:10.349 --> 02:09:11.247
Oh my God!


02:09:12.284 --> 02:09:13.478
Its beautiful!


02:09:13.853 --> 02:09:14.911
- Nice, right?
- Yes!


02:09:17.022 --> 02:09:17.886
Tanya?


02:09:28.033 --> 02:09:29.193
What are you doing, baby?


02:09:29.802 --> 02:09:31.201
Im sorry, Im so happy.


02:09:31.670 --> 02:09:33.900
Kabir just proposed to Natasha.


02:09:33.973 --> 02:09:35.206
What??


02:09:35.207 --> 02:09:37.208
Oh my God!


02:09:37.209 --> 02:09:39.879
You couldve waited until
your mother had cut the cake.


02:09:39.879 --> 02:09:42.871
Kabir, this is the best
birthday gift, ever!


02:09:42.948 --> 02:09:44.049
I love you, son.


02:09:44.050 --> 02:09:45.107
The shy guy!


02:09:45.785 --> 02:09:47.887
Its a double celebration.


02:09:47.887 --> 02:09:49.354
Im so happy.


02:09:50.122 --> 02:09:51.111
Now you have to call me mummy.


02:09:52.625 --> 02:09:54.490
Get some champagne!


02:09:57.196 --> 02:09:58.196
Come here.


02:10:00.199 --> 02:10:01.598
Very good decision.


02:10:03.836 --> 02:10:05.804
Im so happy.


02:10:07.072 --> 02:10:09.597
Babe, what just happened in there?


02:10:09.675 --> 02:10:11.973
- What do you mean?
- I mean...


02:10:12.478 --> 02:10:14.213
This ring...


02:10:14.213 --> 02:10:15.612
I got it for my mom.


02:10:17.616 --> 02:10:19.413
Its her birthday gift.


02:10:20.019 --> 02:10:21.077
This is for your mom?


02:10:21.720 --> 02:10:24.587
Look at it sweety...
its a mummy ring.


02:10:24.657 --> 02:10:26.058
What?


02:10:26.058 --> 02:10:27.423
Why didn't you say something?


02:10:27.893 --> 02:10:29.417
I tried.


02:10:29.495 --> 02:10:33.397
But you were excited and screaming.
And Tanya made an announcement.


02:10:34.066 --> 02:10:36.227
So you don't want to marry me?


02:10:36.669 --> 02:10:40.196
Its not about you.
I havent even thought about marriage.


02:10:42.875 --> 02:10:44.672
What do I tell my father?


02:10:49.648 --> 02:10:52.551
Well say that
we gave it some more thought and...


02:10:52.551 --> 02:10:54.951
we need more time. Thats all.


02:10:55.020 --> 02:10:56.647
This is so embarrassing.


02:10:57.489 --> 02:10:59.548
Im so sorry, sweety.


02:11:00.492 --> 02:11:03.188
You don't ever want to marry me?


02:11:04.463 --> 02:11:06.298
Its not like that.


02:11:06.298 --> 02:11:08.823
If it is, you better tell me right now!


02:11:10.135 --> 02:11:12.838
I really love you, Kabir.
And I don't...


02:11:12.838 --> 02:11:16.069
No, no... no sweety. Dont cry.


02:11:16.141 --> 02:11:17.073
Not now.


02:11:24.450 --> 02:11:25.178
Kabir...


02:11:27.119 --> 02:11:30.816
are you even serious
about this relationship or not?


02:11:34.159 --> 02:11:34.989
You know what...


02:11:46.038 --> 02:11:47.062
Will you marry me?


02:12:11.196 --> 02:12:12.254
Who is it?


02:12:27.146 --> 02:12:28.010
Room service.


02:12:29.214 --> 02:12:29.839
Laila?


02:12:30.883 --> 02:12:31.907
Hi!


02:12:31.984 --> 02:12:32.814
Oh my God!


02:12:34.219 --> 02:12:35.686
Youre here... how... I mean...


02:12:36.121 --> 02:12:38.817
Imran called and
he begged me to come.


02:12:39.158 --> 02:12:40.352
- So I came.
- Imran?


02:12:40.826 --> 02:12:41.850
I knew it.


02:12:42.528 --> 02:12:44.086
He is my best friend.


02:12:47.232 --> 02:12:49.393
I am... so glad youre here.


02:12:50.836 --> 02:12:52.497
Im glad you are glad.


02:12:55.174 --> 02:12:57.335
Hello... my <i>the</i> two <i>the</i> love <i>the</i> birds!


02:12:57.810 --> 02:12:59.141
Hello!


02:12:59.278 --> 02:13:00.336
Surprised, Arjun?


02:13:01.647 --> 02:13:02.705
Thank you.


02:13:02.781 --> 02:13:04.183
Its good to see you.


02:13:04.183 --> 02:13:05.377
- And you.
- Hey gorgeous.


02:13:05.451 --> 02:13:07.519
- I love you too.
- Nice to have you back.


02:13:07.519 --> 02:13:08.884
You got a tan!


02:13:09.655 --> 02:13:10.654
Get dressed, soon!


02:13:10.655 --> 02:13:11.989
- We had to leave at seven.
- Correct.


02:13:11.990 --> 02:13:13.192
- Two minutes?
- You missed me?


02:13:13.193 --> 02:13:14.860
I always miss you, darling.


02:13:14.860 --> 02:13:15.884
Where are we going?


02:13:15.961 --> 02:13:17.588
Its a surprise.
Cant tell you in front of him.


02:13:35.647 --> 02:13:36.807
Whats going on?


02:13:37.216 --> 02:13:38.274
What do you mean?


02:13:38.517 --> 02:13:39.575
Its San Fermin.


02:13:39.651 --> 02:13:40.684
Running with the bulls.


02:13:40.685 --> 02:13:42.085
- Really?
- Didnt you know?


02:13:42.154 --> 02:13:43.280
Just follow me...


02:13:51.563 --> 02:13:52.621
Holy shit!


02:13:59.671 --> 02:14:01.298
Are these guys mad?
What are they doing?


02:14:01.540 --> 02:14:02.336
Suicide.


02:14:02.875 --> 02:14:04.240
Isnt that why you are here?


02:14:14.953 --> 02:14:17.012
I felt this should be the
last experience of our trip.


02:14:17.723 --> 02:14:20.191
This could be the
<i>last</i> experience of our life!


02:14:20.526 --> 02:14:22.694
Stop it, Arjun.
Lets grab a bite.


02:14:22.694 --> 02:14:23.251
Come on.


02:14:24.329 --> 02:14:25.397
- Excuse me.
- Dude are you...


02:14:25.398 --> 02:14:26.625
Im starving!


02:14:28.233 --> 02:14:29.723
This is not an adventure sport.


02:14:30.402 --> 02:14:31.699
I object, Judge <i>sahab</i>!


02:14:32.337 --> 02:14:34.505
I agree its not as safe as regular sports.


02:14:34.506 --> 02:14:36.075
And is illegal in some countries.


02:14:36.075 --> 02:14:38.873
But according to the
Spanish tradition and culture...


02:14:38.944 --> 02:14:39.876
it is allowed.


02:14:39.877 --> 02:14:41.869
And technically,
according to our deal...


02:14:41.947 --> 02:14:44.347
we can choose any sport, remember?


02:14:44.683 --> 02:14:46.185
Imran, its really dangerous, you know.


02:14:46.186 --> 02:14:48.380
Yes, those bulls could kill us, alright?


02:14:48.620 --> 02:14:51.290
Well be dangling on their horns
like tandoori chicken on skewers!


02:14:51.290 --> 02:14:53.019
Precisely the point.


02:14:54.159 --> 02:14:56.218
You want to get rid of
the fear within you?


02:14:56.495 --> 02:14:58.656
Well then, heres
our deepest fear. Death.


02:14:59.698 --> 02:15:00.722
Lets face it.


02:15:01.333 --> 02:15:02.699
Because beyond this fear...


02:15:02.700 --> 02:15:03.599
lies victory!


02:15:03.669 --> 02:15:05.694
Please spare us the tag lines!


02:15:06.138 --> 02:15:07.833
Dude, think about it!


02:15:08.073 --> 02:15:11.702
No training, no instructors.
Just us, my amigos!


02:15:12.444 --> 02:15:14.241
And some bulls running after us.


02:15:14.480 --> 02:15:16.778
If you want to live... just run!


02:15:17.182 --> 02:15:19.343
Laila, do you know
any psychiatrist around here?


02:15:20.119 --> 02:15:22.349
Because our amigo has
completely lost it!


02:15:23.188 --> 02:15:25.213
III be at the starting line
at seven tomorrow morning.


02:15:25.858 --> 02:15:27.826
With or without you.


02:15:33.365 --> 02:15:33.763
I have something for you, Imran.


02:15:33.764 --> 02:15:34.754
I have something for you, Imran.


02:15:35.634 --> 02:15:36.464
Its from Nuria.


02:15:40.239 --> 02:15:41.035
Its in Spanish.


02:15:42.007 --> 02:15:43.269
Love has no language.


02:15:43.876 --> 02:15:44.570
So true.


02:15:47.613 --> 02:15:48.944
I think you should
buy her something.


02:15:49.781 --> 02:15:50.611
Youre absolutely right.


02:15:51.183 --> 02:15:52.741
Guys... next stop - shopping.


02:15:54.186 --> 02:15:55.744
Count me out,
Im going back to the hotel.


02:15:56.822 --> 02:15:57.948
Are you alright?


02:16:00.325 --> 02:16:01.155
Im fine.


02:16:02.027 --> 02:16:03.995
That well only know after a test.


02:16:04.863 --> 02:16:05.659
Test?


02:16:06.899 --> 02:16:08.127
What do you say, Dr. <i>Fraud?</i>.


02:16:09.034 --> 02:16:09.728
Are you game?


02:16:10.335 --> 02:16:11.063
Bring it on.


02:16:11.737 --> 02:16:12.931
You have to say the first thing...


02:16:13.005 --> 02:16:14.973
I know the drill. Ask!


02:16:15.874 --> 02:16:16.602
Black.


02:16:16.842 --> 02:16:17.399
Night.


02:16:17.476 --> 02:16:18.340
Sea.


02:16:18.510 --> 02:16:19.238
Salty.


02:16:19.311 --> 02:16:20.144
Work.


02:16:20.145 --> 02:16:21.146
Money.


02:16:21.146 --> 02:16:22.010
Sex.


02:16:22.214 --> 02:16:23.048
I like!


02:16:23.048 --> 02:16:23.571
Friend.


02:16:23.949 --> 02:16:24.677
You.


02:16:24.883 --> 02:16:25.850
Marriage.


02:16:27.186 --> 02:16:28.346
Family.


02:16:35.194 --> 02:16:36.024
What?


02:16:37.829 --> 02:16:39.331
Is that all?


02:16:39.331 --> 02:16:40.628
It was enough.


02:16:42.501 --> 02:16:44.169
Smartass...


02:16:44.169 --> 02:16:47.866
Youre using my trick on me?
Just say what you want to.


02:16:48.407 --> 02:16:49.305
Okay.


02:16:50.042 --> 02:16:52.442
You hesitated on marriage.


02:16:52.878 --> 02:16:54.277
So?


02:16:54.346 --> 02:16:57.804
Im just saying...
you hesitated... on marriage.


02:17:01.787 --> 02:17:02.651
Look...


02:17:03.655 --> 02:17:07.182
I don't have the time for this crap.
See you later.


02:17:10.963 --> 02:17:13.591
- Okay.
- Im sorry, Im going to...


02:17:21.506 --> 02:17:22.473
Kabir.


02:17:27.613 --> 02:17:28.409
Go!


02:17:31.316 --> 02:17:32.442
Kabir!


02:17:33.452 --> 02:17:34.919
Kabir... man, just stop!


02:17:35.621 --> 02:17:36.747
What?


02:17:37.856 --> 02:17:39.721
Talk to us man. Whats going on?


02:17:40.125 --> 02:17:41.990
Its nothing, really.


02:17:43.962 --> 02:17:44.929
Kabir...


02:17:46.898 --> 02:17:49.196
Look, Im sorry I lost my cool.


02:17:50.502 --> 02:17:52.834
Because I said you have
a problem with marriage?


02:17:53.705 --> 02:17:56.970
I guess, Im freaking out.
I don't know whats happening.


02:17:57.376 --> 02:17:59.710
Its normal to be nervous.


02:17:59.711 --> 02:18:02.214
Its not like youre having
an arranged marriage.


02:18:02.214 --> 02:18:04.876
Yeah, but she isnt
the same person I met.


02:18:05.550 --> 02:18:07.711
Shes changed,
shes become possessive.


02:18:08.320 --> 02:18:11.619
The girl I knew was a
talented, independent interior designer.


02:18:11.790 --> 02:18:13.825
She enjoyed her work.


02:18:13.825 --> 02:18:14.792
But now...


02:18:15.360 --> 02:18:17.328
shes bid adieu to her passion and...


02:18:17.562 --> 02:18:19.462
taken over my life.


02:18:20.399 --> 02:18:22.401
Of course, I want a partner but...


02:18:22.401 --> 02:18:24.096
I want my own life too!


02:18:24.403 --> 02:18:28.203
The whole <i>two bodies, one soul</i> thing
I wont be able to handle it.


02:18:38.884 --> 02:18:40.875
- May I ask you something?
- Yes.


02:18:42.187 --> 02:18:44.417
Dont you think
you proposed to her too soon?


02:18:45.157 --> 02:18:47.325
Actually, I didn't even propose.


02:18:47.326 --> 02:18:48.894
What?


02:18:48.894 --> 02:18:51.226
Id bought a ring for my mom
as a birthday gift.


02:18:51.496 --> 02:18:54.897
Before giving it, I happened to show
it to Natasha and she thought...


02:18:55.334 --> 02:18:56.801
it was meant for her.


02:18:58.570 --> 02:19:00.265
- Are you crazy?
- What are you doing?


02:19:00.739 --> 02:19:02.536
- Whats wrong with him?
- What's wrong with him?


02:19:07.846 --> 02:19:10.212
No wonder this vacation was
so important for you.


02:19:10.949 --> 02:19:11.608
Meaning?


02:19:12.718 --> 02:19:15.949
Basically, you wanted to hear from someone
else that you shouldn't get married.


02:19:16.154 --> 02:19:18.856
And besides us,
who wouldve told you this.


02:19:18.857 --> 02:19:20.726
Have you totally lost it?


02:19:20.726 --> 02:19:23.388
The invites are printed.
This isnt the time to overreact!


02:19:24.363 --> 02:19:25.330
Kabir.


02:19:26.865 --> 02:19:28.526
We know Natasha is a great girl.


02:19:28.800 --> 02:19:30.768
And we know you like her.


02:19:31.303 --> 02:19:32.793
And of course,
you don't want to hurt her.


02:19:33.839 --> 02:19:36.808
But ask yourself...
Do you really want to marry her?


02:19:37.542 --> 02:19:39.203
And if not, be honest.


02:19:39.277 --> 02:19:40.767
To yourself and to her.


02:19:41.480 --> 02:19:44.381
Of course, shell be hurt.
But in the long run its best for both of you.


02:19:44.549 --> 02:19:46.176
He is absolutely right, Kabir.


02:19:46.451 --> 02:19:48.248
But Ive made a commitment.


02:19:48.620 --> 02:19:50.355
Okay, you screwed up.


02:19:50.355 --> 02:19:52.380
No ones going to send you to prison.


02:19:52.457 --> 02:19:55.017
Its not that simple.
Our parents are involved.


02:19:55.227 --> 02:19:56.057
Parents?


02:19:56.495 --> 02:19:57.621
Dude, its your life.


02:20:00.699 --> 02:20:02.030
You wont get it.


02:20:03.201 --> 02:20:04.031
Just...


02:20:04.703 --> 02:20:06.864
Just let it be, okay? Im sorry.


02:20:07.706 --> 02:20:08.832
Kabir...


02:20:12.611 --> 02:20:13.578
What a guy!


02:20:31.830 --> 02:20:32.854
Laila?


02:20:36.802 --> 02:20:37.826
Why're you shouting?


02:20:38.904 --> 02:20:40.531
Why are you so far?


02:20:54.820 --> 02:20:55.718
Better?


02:20:57.055 --> 02:20:57.885
Best.


02:21:00.959 --> 02:21:01.687
Ammi?


02:21:02.828 --> 02:21:04.295
How are you?


02:21:07.199 --> 02:21:09.167
I met Salman.


02:21:15.540 --> 02:21:18.566
I now know why you and Abu
kept this from me.


02:21:22.180 --> 02:21:23.238
Im sorry, Ammi.


02:21:26.184 --> 02:21:27.242
I love you.


02:21:29.020 --> 02:21:30.544
I love you too, my boy.


02:22:06.858 --> 02:22:10.316
<i>It took a while but.</i>


02:22:15.233 --> 02:22:19.636
<i>I've now learnt to live.</i>


02:22:24.109 --> 02:22:27.806
<i>Without the consolation of tears.</i>


02:22:32.484 --> 02:22:37.148
<i>I've now learnt to live.</i>


02:22:57.042 --> 02:23:03.715
<i>There is someone who brought to mind.</i>


02:23:03.715 --> 02:23:08.277
<i>How I had gotten left behind.</i>


02:23:10.021 --> 02:23:15.687
<i>Life is like a caravan.</i>


02:23:16.828 --> 02:23:20.787
<i>Why are you lonely, my man.</i>


02:23:23.201 --> 02:23:27.661
<i>Just know that we are all here.</i>


02:23:50.862 --> 02:23:53.922
The first rocket indicates that
the pen gates have been opened.


02:23:54.332 --> 02:23:56.800
Second rocket indicates that
the bulls are coming towards us.


02:23:57.135 --> 02:23:58.837
We run at the second rocket.


02:23:58.837 --> 02:23:59.701
Second rocket.


02:24:01.339 --> 02:24:02.897
Oh San Fermin, please protect us.


02:24:04.843 --> 02:24:06.174
If I die...


02:24:06.544 --> 02:24:08.273
my spirit will come back to haunt you.


02:24:08.713 --> 02:24:10.237
Why are you thinking about death?


02:24:10.315 --> 02:24:12.283
Think about what youll do
if you survive.


02:24:16.855 --> 02:24:17.855
Listen...


02:24:18.023 --> 02:24:18.921
a new pact.


02:24:19.791 --> 02:24:21.486
An if-I-get out-alive pact.


02:24:22.661 --> 02:24:25.221
If I get out alive,
III let you read my poetry.


02:24:26.398 --> 02:24:27.899
Why just you? III just...


02:24:27.899 --> 02:24:29.093
get it published.


02:24:29.968 --> 02:24:30.935
You write poetry?


02:24:31.169 --> 02:24:31.999
Yes.


02:24:33.805 --> 02:24:34.772
Okay.


02:24:35.073 --> 02:24:36.904
If I get out alive...


02:24:39.978 --> 02:24:40.672
Okay!


02:24:41.146 --> 02:24:42.980
If I get out alive...


02:24:42.981 --> 02:24:45.016
III go to Morocco with Laila.


02:24:45.016 --> 02:24:45.846
Yeah!


02:24:46.184 --> 02:24:47.208
Thats what III do.


02:24:47.619 --> 02:24:49.786
Whats the worst that could happen?
III get fired.


02:24:49.787 --> 02:24:50.789
- Right?
- Yeah.


02:24:50.790 --> 02:24:51.990
Who cares man?


02:24:51.990 --> 02:24:53.184
III be with her and I will live.


02:24:53.558 --> 02:24:54.718
Well done, my bro!


02:24:55.727 --> 02:24:56.557
Come on, Kabir.


02:24:58.963 --> 02:24:59.631
Okay.


02:24:59.632 --> 02:25:01.326
If I get out alive...


02:25:05.470 --> 02:25:07.028
Shit guys! The gates are open!


02:25:07.372 --> 02:25:08.430
Kabir just say it.


02:25:08.506 --> 02:25:10.201
Its okay, just say it.


02:25:17.482 --> 02:25:20.318
If I get out alive,
III go to London...


02:25:20.318 --> 02:25:22.047
and tell Natasha that...


02:25:31.863 --> 02:25:33.262
Say what? Just say it!


02:25:33.531 --> 02:25:34.759
Come on, Kabir!


02:25:38.737 --> 02:25:40.637
- Come on, Kabir!
- Come on!


02:25:40.705 --> 02:25:43.299
<i>I'm sorry but I can't marry you.</i>


02:25:45.510 --> 02:25:46.175
- Congratulations!
- Look out!


02:25:46.176 --> 02:25:47.405
- Congratulations!
- Look out!


02:28:29.974 --> 02:28:32.677
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your restlessness in your heart.


02:28:32.677 --> 02:28:34.736
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:28:34.812 --> 02:28:37.372
<i>If you're carrying</i>
the lightning of dreams in your eyes.


02:28:37.448 --> 02:28:38.642
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:28:39.951 --> 02:28:42.943
<i>Like a gust of wind</i>,
learn to live free.


02:28:43.621 --> 02:28:46.590
<i>Learn to flow like</i>
the waves that make a sea.


02:28:47.225 --> 02:28:50.353
<i>Let your arms be wide open</i>,
to every moment you meet.


02:28:51.062 --> 02:28:54.554
<i>May every moment gift you</i>
a new sight to greet.


02:28:55.166 --> 02:28:57.566
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your wonder in your eyes.


02:28:57.635 --> 02:28:59.500
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:29:00.204 --> 02:29:03.298
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your restlessness in your heart.


02:29:04.309 --> 02:29:05.435
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:29:15.853 --> 02:29:15.887
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:15.888 --> 02:29:19.724
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:19.724 --> 02:29:23.455
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:23.528 --> 02:29:27.430
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:27.498 --> 02:29:31.161
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:31.302 --> 02:29:35.139
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:35.139 --> 02:29:38.506
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:47.318 --> 02:29:51.687
<i>Just when the heart</i>
started moving to another beat.


02:29:54.993 --> 02:29:59.453
<i>Out of nowhere</i>
a new thought found its feet.


02:30:02.533 --> 02:30:06.370
<i>That life gives you just one shot.</i>


02:30:06.371 --> 02:30:10.041
<i>So why not love it with all you've got.</i>


02:30:10.041 --> 02:30:13.909
<i>Who knows what we're waiting for</i>


02:30:13.978 --> 02:30:18.210
<i>'Cause life is here and life is now.</i>


02:30:21.886 --> 02:30:26.914
<i>What was only a desire till yesterday.</i>


02:30:29.660 --> 02:30:33.960
<i>Is exactly what we've found today.</i>


02:30:37.035 --> 02:30:40.027
<i>Hand in hand let's always be.</i>


02:30:40.872 --> 02:30:44.000
<i>As we wander through our destiny.</i>


02:30:44.609 --> 02:30:48.279
<i>And all day and all night.</i>


02:30:48.279 --> 02:30:53.307
<i>Happiness rains down on</i>
everything in sight.


02:30:55.520 --> 02:30:59.557
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:30:59.557 --> 02:31:03.288
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:31:03.361 --> 02:31:07.198
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:31:07.198 --> 02:31:11.362
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:31:27.285 --> 02:31:30.118
<i>If it can knit a new dream everyday.</i>


02:31:31.122 --> 02:31:33.989
<i>Then you can call it a life.</i>


02:31:34.892 --> 02:31:37.725
<i>If it can lead you down a brand new way.</i>


02:31:38.796 --> 02:31:41.594
<i>Then you can call it a life.</i>


02:31:42.333 --> 02:31:45.234
<i>If it can flirt and fly</i>,
If it can spin and jive.


02:31:45.303 --> 02:31:52.770
<i>Then you can call it a life</i>
